[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10861.59, "timestamp": "03:01:01", "text": "我没说，我还没说过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10866.15, "timestamp": "03:01:06", "text": "仅仅是因为我有个朋友，而我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10868.79, "timestamp": "03:01:08", "text": "她说过一次，她说的是橙色的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10871.67, "timestamp": "03:01:11", "text": "这种行为很不尊重人，而且感觉就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10873.269, "timestamp": "03:01:13", "text": "她把一切都解释给我听了。她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10875.03, "timestamp": "03:01:15", "text": "她态度非常好，还问我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10877.59, "timestamp": "03:01:17", "text": "不说出来，只是为了她，我从未"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10887.03, "timestamp": "03:01:27", "text": "这就是它的特点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10888.71, "timestamp": "03:01:28", "text": "当人们态度友善且喜欢它的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10890.15, "timestamp": "03:01:30", "text": "他们告诉你不要做某事，而我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10892.389, "timestamp": "03:01:32", "text": "好吧，我会尊重你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10894.79, "timestamp": "03:01:34", "text": "文化之类的东西，我不会做的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10897.269, "timestamp": "03:01:37", "text": "那。但人们一提到“R”这个词就……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10899.75, "timestamp": "03:01:39", "text": "比如，如果你用了那个R开头的词，你就会变成这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10902.15, "timestamp": "03:01:42", "text": "就是这样。我当时就想，好吧好吧，这太蠢了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10911.83, "timestamp": "03:01:51", "text": "乔克，你在吗？是的。是的。是的。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10915.11, "timestamp": "03:01:55", "text": "就像想想那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10918.309, "timestamp": "03:01:58", "text": "比如思考如何使用"}]